<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details seeding, crop progress.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details seeding, crop progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of seeding progress to Monday, May 26.</p>
<p>CROP     PCT COMPLETED	 PCT EMERGED</p>
<p>	   1997   92/96 AVG    1997  92/96 AVG</p>
<p>S.Wheat  89 pct  89 pct	37 pct  43 pct</p>
<p>Oats     65 pct  71 pct	27 pct  34 pct</p>
<p>Barley   64 pct  69 pct	32 pct  33 pct</p>
<p>Canola   71 pct  71 pct	31 pct  31 pct</p>
<p>Flax     91 pct  80 pct	47 pct  32 pct</p>
<p>Peas     89 pct  92 pct	43 pct  43 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
